        "id": 1963520
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-09T00:14:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Battery status as displayed in the UI is the result of selecting one data source from, or aggregating, multiple data sources. The `status` command is intended to show the resulting battery status that should be displayed in the UI, while the `status-all` should show the data from all battery sources pre-selection/aggregation.",
      "parentUuid": "af558741_8420a2ec",
      "revId": "00502d20643277e1362035b1169ef25b84ea5f55",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
